@startuml
' So do 6: Activity - pipeline 12 lop kiem chung mot request sua diem
title Pipeline 12 lop kiem chung (request sua diem)

start
:1. WAF OWASP CRS v4\nloc SQLi / XSS / path traversal / scanner UA;
if (CRS chan?) then (co)
  :403 tu nginx;
  stop
endif
:2. Rate limit\n10 login / 300 API moi 15 phut / IP;
if (vuot nguong?) then (co)
  :audit RATE_LIMITED (WARN);
  :429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS;
  stop
endif
:3. JWT: chu ky HS256 co dinh, iss, aud, exp;
if (khong hop le?) then (co)
  :audit JWT_INVALID (HIGH);
  :401 INVALID_TOKEN;
  stop
endif
:4. Session trong DB: ton tai, dung sub,\nchua revoke, chua het han;
if (sid la?) then (co)
  :audit SESSION_UNKNOWN (CRITICAL)\n-> nghi lo JWT_SECRET;
  :401 INVALID_SESSION;
  stop
endif
:5. Fingerprint SHA-256(User-Agent + IP);
if (khac ngu canh?) then (co)
  :revoke session + audit\nSESSION_CONTEXT_MISMATCH (CRITICAL);
  :401;
  stop
endif
:6. MFA da xac minh trong phien;
if (mfa_verified = false?) then (co)
  :401 MFA_REQUIRED;
  stop
endif
:7. RBAC: role doc tu bang users;
if (khong du vai tro?) then (co)
  :audit ACCESS_DENIED_ROLE (HIGH);
  :403 FORBIDDEN;
  stop
endif
:8. Step-up OTP: ma moi, chua tung dung (90s);
if (thieu / sai / replay?) then (co)
  :audit STEP_UP_FAIL_* (HIGH);
  :401 STEP_UP_REQUIRED;
  stop
endif
:9. Validation: kieu, mien 0-10, do dai reason;
if (khong hop le?) then (co)
  :audit INPUT_REJECTED (WARN);
  :400 INVALID_INPUT;
  stop
endif
:10. Ownership: GV phai day lop chua enrollmentId;
if (khong phai chu so huu?) then (co)
  :audit ACCESS_DENIED_IDOR (HIGH);
  :403 / 404;
  stop
endif
:11. Parameterized query + quyen DB toi thieu\n(app_user khong DELETE, khong DDL);
:12. Audit hash-chain trong cung transaction;
:200 OK;
stop
@enduml
